  "feature": "Use Binance published settled USD-M funding events in (t-15min-24h, t-15min]. Require at least 3 observations with no >9h gap including boundaries, latest rate positive and exact 24h sum >=0.0003. Pure X8 short rebuy tags 561, 562, 563 only. FundingRebuyBoost increases first stake to 2.5x if eligible else 1x; FlatRebuyBoost increases all scoped to 2.5x. Keep 1x leverage, 40 contracts, original native allocation bounds, position adjustment and signal/exit code. Retain realized model funding in NAV.",
  "hypothesis": "Positive funding can identify crowded long positioning at native short entries; check directional price PnL apart from funding income and test a uniform boost.",
  "attribution_gate": "At each cost require at least 12 flagged natural closes, positive flagged price PnL per cumulative filled entry notional, and greater net PnL per entry notional than other pure short-rebuy trades in both 2024 and 2025-Aug2026. Cohorts are based on original trades, not counterfactual NAV.",
  "native_gate": "Always run four native temporal accounts for 65 days (two controls at two costs, original reused). At both costs require net return above original and positive, return/5m drawdown above unconditional 2.5x, drawdown <= original +1pp, at least 20 complete campaigns and 4 scoped boosted fills. Run all four 20-month accounts only after native and attribution gates pass; then require same economic gates plus net return above original in both slices, 60 complete campaigns and 12 boosted fills. Prior original return paths are known. Historical evidence only.",
